{
  "name": "Nizlo - list offline Windows endpoints",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 620,
        "height": 220,
        "content": "## Read-only offline-Windows endpoint starter\n\n**Prerequisites:** self-hosted n8n with the public `n8n-nodes-nizlo` community node installed, plus a Nizlo personal access token whose effective permissions include `devices.view`.\n\nThis workflow starts inactive, contains no credential, and retrieves at most 100 active Windows endpoints currently reported offline. Select a local Nizlo credential before the first manual run. It does not send messages, create tickets, run scripts, patch or reboot endpoints, open remote sessions, or change Nizlo data."
      },
      "id": "d3ceba57-289b-44ad-b7c4-b2dfeb3a9cf9",
      "name": "Read this first",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [220, 40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "029063f5-c9f7-4545-95c8-008348a5b2b6",
      "name": "Run manually",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [260, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "device",
        "operation": "getMany",
        "returnAll": false,
        "limit": 100,
        "deviceFilters": {
          "status": "offline",
          "platform": "WINDOWS",
          "summary": true,
          "lifecycle": "active"
        }
      },
      "id": "9f294e05-b460-44f7-b23c-013d9906bbf0",
      "name": "Get offline Windows endpoints",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-nizlo.nizlo",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [500, 300]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
